--- !u!114 &5101238049854056426
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5868243987219838111}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9084ae1e762be841ab703fe38863964, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VRIFDialogueSystem
  dialogueTextDisplay: {fileID: 5818140339590296822}
  dialogueUIPanel: {fileID: 5868243987219838111}
  teleportFadeScript: {fileID: 0}
  audioSource: {fileID: 4373535197830067676}
  npcAnimator: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueTransitionDuration: 0.4
  endAnimationStateName: Idle
  endTransitionDuration: 0.3
  onDialogueSequenceEnded:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  autoTeleportOnEnd: 1
  typeSpeed: 0.065
  delayBetweenSentences: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - sentence: Selamat datang, Bapak/Ibu. Saat ini kami akan melakukan pemeriksaan
      awal di nurse station sebagai bagian dari persiapan tindakan operasi CABG.
      Kami akan melakukan pemeriksaan tekanan darah, nadi, pernapasan dan suhu tubuh
      untuk memantau kondisi kesehatan anda saat ini
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce7417f46a337f14a9e776068f92094e, type: 3}
    animationStateName: NPCDialogue
    waitForButtonPress: 0
    hideMainPanelDuringWait: 1
    onLineStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onLineFinished:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentence: Setelah pemeriksaan, kami akan memberikan edukasi terkait persiapan
      dan perawatan, serta melakukan pengecekan obat yang sedang dikonsumsi anda
      untuk memastikan keamanan selama perawatan
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8379cb0a3f3e7cc4caa59eef13e4fdb3, type: 3}
    animationStateName: Idle
    waitForButtonPress: 0
    hideMainPanelDuringWait: 1
    onLineStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onLineFinished:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentence: Anda harus berhenti meminum obat pengencer 7 hari sebelum tindakan
      operasi, apabila ada obat herbal atau obat cina yang berdampak terhadap risiko
      perdarahan maka wajib info ke dokter atau perawat. Perawat akan membantu mengatur
      pengingat penghentian obat di handphone Anda
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffb2b0d149b769b40b54aa5dd325c4df, type: 3}
    animationStateName: NPCDialogue
    waitForButtonPress: 0
    hideMainPanelDuringWait: 1
    onLineStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onLineFinished:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentence: Apakah obat pengencer darah yang anda minum ada didalam daftar obat
      berikut? Jika ada silahkan di ceklis
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a072dd84d2be4b42a6914d5087bad35, type: 3}
    animationStateName: Idle
    waitForButtonPress: 1
    hideMainPanelDuringWait: 1
    onLineStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onLineFinished:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: VRPanelController, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: ShowPanel
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  - sentence: Selanjutnya, anda akan mengikuti anxiety test untuk mengetahui kondisi
      psikologis sebelum tindakan
    dialogueAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e4d02d2747c00b498fac7b7165a1cd2, type: 3}
    animationStateName: Idle
    waitForButtonPress: 1
    hideMainPanelDuringWait: 1
    onLineStarted:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onLineFinished:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: VRPanelController, Assembly-CSharp
